        "action_date": "2025-02-07",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p>This bill requires the Centers for Medicare &amp; Medicaid Services (CMS) to establish drug adherence guidelines for covered drugs under Medicare so as to achieve an adherence rate of 90%. The CMS must incorporate artificial&nbsp;intelligence and machine-learning technologies and promote generics and biosimilars when developing the guidance.</p>",
